@@ -0,0 +1,26 @@
+# Customer-visible source-to-screen findings
+
+Starting source e7ecd1b72944e36481668554d05dc4e321e7b3de / tree1502404775deac8eb657d62b855bbac62aed374c. Source inspection and disposable prepared controls are distinct from the product owner's supplied live observations. No new owner live observation or private payload export is claimed. Validation outcomes are reported separately in the immutable release evidence; this inventory does not claim a gate passed.
+
+| Case | Source → screen trace | Classification | Implemented resolution / remaining boundary |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Player projection limitation | Sleeper prepared player projection → player_projection_view.participation_note/reason → selected Market | Existing compatible explanation lost in rendering; source value intact | Preserve the specific availability restriction beside the unchanged projection, including supported zero. Actual results remain independently qualified. Matched missing-statistics/zero-Out rendered controls. |
+| Home search state | Typed Trade503 capacity response → home-opportunities.js catch → status/loading state | Consumer dropped typed deferral and left loading; not failed evaluator or evidence of no offers | Explicit deferred/failed/interrupted state, earlier results labeled, explicit retry; no request or admission change. |
+| Comparison rationale repetition | Recorded partner case, conditions and limitations → repeated default paragraphs | Existing supported trade comparison was dominated by raw diagnostic prose | Keep decision, exchange, costs, supported effects, depth, roster space and qualified material risks visible. Complete original rationale and conditions remain unchanged in the existing disclosure, without another evaluation. |
+| Retained offer identity | Recorded review presentation → comparison action → current workspace asset labels | Comparison could replace recorded names with today's labels while retaining old evaluation | Use the retained exact presentation in comparison, or exact IDs when legacy names are missing. Preserve source asset order and NOT REVALIDATED qualification; no current valuation or identity is substituted. |
+| Unknown franchise outlook | Existing model classification UNAVAILABLE → executive summary interpolation → Front Office | Presentation turns unknown into franchise characterization | Supported observed facts plus specific missing outlook; exact original model summary accessible on demand. No model result replaced. |
+| Overall grade / forecast tiles | Unset composite/forecast fields → Home/team/Market/player/Commissioner | Unimplemented models, not proven source loss | Omit unsupported normal metrics, explain limits once on demand; preserve real supported metrics and zero. No forecasts invented. |
+| Pick price/range | Exact retained pick → compatible Market availability → pick cards | Genuine missing/incompatible quote or unimplemented range repeated multiple times | One price limitation; exact identity visible, ranges only when supported; no zero substitution. |
+| Historical pick actions | Retained transfer/conversion plus future native ledger → pick details | UI action could imply current tradability without unique future ownership evidence | Require unique exact future compatible right and matching observed owner before action. Historical/foreign/conflicting/unknown evidence stays factual and non-purchasable. |
+| Season draft/postseason | Existing retained season_archive draft/bracket → normal JSON destinations | Compatible retained facts lacked readable presentation | Bounded readable sections in existing season archive; no acquisition. Raw picked_by user ID is not roster identity, and old aliases do not establish original pick franchise. Unknown origin remains unknown. |
+| History coverage | Acquisition receipts and last-valid state → repeated week lists | Evidence correct, presentation repetitive | Season coverage/activity and retained qualification visible once; exact weeks/provenance accessible on demand. Missing is not empty. |
+| Manager-profile waiting state | Default waiting lifecycle with no saved profiles → progress headline | Waiting did not establish that a worker was running | Only observed running reports preparation in progress; waiting reports not prepared yet. Other evidence families remain independently qualified. No work is started. |
+| Invalid Commissioner scalars | Retained scalar assessments → headline card support gate | Presentation treated nonfinite or null-like values as supported and exposed missing raw counters | Reuse the existing availability formatter for the display support gate; missing counters are not established. Matched C10 component replay reproduces invalid cards; supported zero and negative values remain unchanged. No model or counter calculation changed. |
+| Commissioner counts | Recorded classifications / pick lists → headline counters | Missing coverage denominator; counts are observations, not complete league inventory | Recorded labels and explicit completeness qualification; no core counter/policy change. |
+| Roster entry placement | Aggregated projection/availability coverage → long block before first roster row | Correct evidence displaced the first roster action beyond the existing 600px phone acceptance bound | Keep a compact projection count at Full Roster and the one complete coverage explanation after its rows. Preserve named material player risks beside each player and the unchanged geometry threshold. |
+| Roster portrait/name overlap | Compact 40px portrait wrapper → inherited 52px fallback portrait | Introduced layout defect confirmed in actual 375px rendered screenshot | Bind portrait children to the real wrapper size. Rendered geometry verifies every visible roster name remains outside the fallback, without reducing text size. |
+| Owner-observation clock meaning | Existing timeline source semantics → simplified intermediate-candidate explanation | Review caught a presentation regression before deployment: observation clocks could lose their acquisition-time qualification | Restore the distinction once in existing source details: recorded current-owner as-of times describe retrieval/sync observations, not acquisition or ownership changes. Preserve exact clocks and the plain visible gap warning. No historical event or source clock is reconstructed. |
+| Time display | Exact ISO or explicitly normalized UTC clocks → inconsistent technical/naive labels | Presentation precision/timezone boundary | Human known-zone clocks, date-only precision preserved; naive timezone unknown; originals retained. |
+| Dead matchup helper | Unused _production_ranks absent-score coercion | No caller or demonstrated customer effect | Not changed or represented as a source fix. |
+
+Preserved boundaries: Sleeper alone supplies fantasy projections/results; native zero/negative/precision/conflicts; compatible generation/scoring/league ownership; exact picks; Neutral/Custom methods; bilateral and FOIS policy; submitted lineups; saved settings; account isolation; 2GiB/16x/FOIS/Trade lifecycle policy. No upstream reconstruction, provider additions, new permanent source store or page-render acquisition.
